    "detailed_description": "Zombots is a fast-paced FPS inspired by the intensity of Doom and the charm and replayability of Brotatoe. Blast your way through hordes of enemies in style while listening to the adrenaline-pumping soundtrack. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966810/extras/5157f24670941e021c28058318e403eb.poster.avif?t=1741354834\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966810/extras/5157f24670941e021c28058318e403eb.webm?t=1741354834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966810/extras/5157f24670941e021c28058318e403eb.mp4?t=1741354834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><strong>Roguelike Gameplay:</strong> Survive wave after wave as you upgrade your arsenal and unlock new abilities to meet the increasing difficulty. Survive until daybreak, or die trying. <br><br><strong>Powerful Weapons:</strong> Fire away with a variety of exotic guns. From the rapid-fire shotgun to the sticky plasma launcher, you\u2019ll surely find the right tool for the job. Upgrade your weapons to unlock their full potential. <br><br><strong>Unique Abilities:</strong> Augment your character to turn the tides against the invaders with abilities such as an evasive dash, devastating energy sword, automatic shoulder-turrets and more.<br><br><strong>Dangerous Enemies: </strong>Between the mindless drones, stealthy assassins, towering titans and more, you\u2019ll need to keep your senses sharp and your fingers trigger-happy if you want to survive each night.<br><br><strong>Leaderboards: </strong>Grow and maintain your score multiplier while clearing levels to set a new high score as you work your way up the ranks.",
    "about_the_game": "Zombots is a fast-paced FPS inspired by the intensity of Doom and the charm and replayability of Brotatoe. Blast your way through hordes of enemies in style while listening to the adrenaline-pumping soundtrack. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966810/extras/5157f24670941e021c28058318e403eb.poster.avif?t=1741354834\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966810/extras/5157f24670941e021c28058318e403eb.webm?t=1741354834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966810/extras/5157f24670941e021c28058318e403eb.mp4?t=1741354834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><strong>Roguelike Gameplay:</strong> Survive wave after wave as you upgrade your arsenal and unlock new abilities to meet the increasing difficulty. Survive until daybreak, or die trying. <br><br><strong>Powerful Weapons:</strong> Fire away with a variety of exotic guns. From the rapid-fire shotgun to the sticky plasma launcher, you\u2019ll surely find the right tool for the job. Upgrade your weapons to unlock their full potential. <br><br><strong>Unique Abilities:</strong> Augment your character to turn the tides against the invaders with abilities such as an evasive dash, devastating energy sword, automatic shoulder-turrets and more.<br><br><strong>Dangerous Enemies: </strong>Between the mindless drones, stealthy assassins, towering titans and more, you\u2019ll need to keep your senses sharp and your fingers trigger-happy if you want to survive each night.<br><br><strong>Leaderboards: </strong>Grow and maintain your score multiplier while clearing levels to set a new high score as you work your way up the ranks.",
